650 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 280 0 R
/E (Take rest days and don't stress about a few days that you don't study. Nobody can be productive for 4 months straight. Still live your life and if you're busy for a whole week and you can't study don't stress. There's no point on taking breaks if you are stressed that you are breaking so just genuinely take your rest days so you can go back to studying refreshed.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [14]
>>
